Date: Sun, 8 Nov 2026 07:04:38 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Tidy the student dashboard on phones

- One slim renewal notice instead of two stacked banners, so the Continue
  card is on the first screen. The pay button sits inside the notice and
  goes inline on wide screens.
- Weekly goal and course coverage sit side by side on phones, with the
  streak card on its own row above them.
- Ask AI shortcuts scroll sideways on phones instead of wrapping onto
  three rows.
- Slightly tighter spacing between sections on small screens.
